From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 05:25:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] WIP: F-219 - zeppelin move module + module installer

- zeppelin/modules/move: process-mode gameplay module. move.position / move.to (blocking
  straight-line walk: SET_FACING, START_FORWARD, HEARTBEAT every 500 ms at run speed, STOP)
  / move.stop. Tracks position from SMSG_LOGIN_VERIFY_WORLD and answers what the core does
  not: MSG_MOVE_TELEPORT_ACK, SMSG_NEW_WORLD -> MSG_MOVE_WORLDPORT_ACK, every
  SMSG_FORCE_*_CHANGE (ack = opcode+1, run speed carries an extra u8)
- MovementInfo layout matches AzerothCore WorldSession::ReadMovementInfo
- zeppelin/install.sh <module_dir> [module...]: go build + protoc descriptor set + manifest
- verified live: 20 yd walk accepted, server saved the exact target on logout

